cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this analysis code, please cite both the software and the
  associated article.
title: >-
  Iso-heart-rate, cross-corpus evaluation of wrist-wearable stress detection
  (analysis code)
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for an iso-heart-rate, cross-corpus evaluation of binary
  stress-versus-non-stress detection from wrist-worn Empatica E4 recordings
  across the WESAD, Stress-Predict and Nurse corpora. Includes the iso-HR
  matching procedure, leave-one-subject-out and leave-one-dataset-out
  protocols, unsupervised domain-adaptation baselines, an accelerometer
  context-aware transfer model, error stratification, and the reviewer-requested
  robustness analyses.
